    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Manaseh, Boqorkii Yahuudah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Manaseh markuu boqor noqday wuxuu jiray laba iyo toban sannadood; oo Yeruusaalemna wuxuu boqor ka ahaa shan iyo konton sannadood, oo hooyadiis magaceeduna wuxuu ahaa Xefsiibaah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isna wuxuu sameeyey wax Rabbiga hortiisa shar ku ahaa, sidii karaahiyadii quruumihii Rabbigu ka eryay reer binu Israa'iil hortooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, wuxuu mar kale dhisay meelihii sarsare ee aabbihiis Xisqiyaah baabbi'iyey, oo Bacalna meelo allabari buu u dhisay, oo geedo Asheeraahna wuu sameeyey siduu yeelay Axaab oo ahaa boqorkii dalka Israa'iil, oo wuxuu caabuday oo u wada adeegay ciidanka samada oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu meelo allabari ka dhex dhisay gurigii Rabbiga, kaasoo Rabbigu ka hadlay oo yidhi, Magacayga waxaan dhigayaa Yeruusaalem dhexdeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu ciidanka samada oo dhan meelo allabari uga dhisay labadii barxadood oo gurigii Rabbiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wiilkiisiina dab buu dhex mariyey, faalna wuu ku noqnoqday, wuxuuna u tegey falanfallowyo, wuuna la macaamilooday kuwii ruuxaanta lahaa iyo saaxiriintii, oo wuxuu Rabbiga hortiisa ku sameeyey shar badan oo uu isaga kaga xanaajiyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sanamkii xardhanaa ee geedihii Asheeraah ee uu sameeyey ayuu dhex qotomiyey gurigii Rabbigu ka hadlay oo Daa'uud iyo wiilkiisii Sulaymaanba ku yidhi, Gurigan iyo Yeruusaalem dhexdeeda oo aan ka doortay qabiilooyinka reer binu Israa'iil oo dhan ayaan magacayga weligiisba ku dayn doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo cagaha reer binu Israa'iilna mar dambe ka dhigi maayo kuwo ka wareega dalkii aan awowayaashood siiyey, hadday dhawraan uun wixii aan ku amray oo dhan, iyo sharcigii addoonkaygii Muuse ku amray oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse way dhegaysan waayeen, oo Manaseh ayaa iyagii ku sasabay inay sameeyaan shar ka sii badan kii ay sameeyeen quruumihii Rabbigu ku hor baabbi'iyey reer binu Israa'iil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Rabbigu ka dhex hadlay nebiyadii addoommadiisa ahaa, oo yidhi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manaseh oo ah boqorka dalka Yahuudah ayaa sameeyey karaahiyadan, wuuna sameeyey shar ka sii badan kii reer Amorkii isaga ka horreeyey ay sameeyeen, oo dadka Yahuudahna wuxuu ku dembaajiyey sanamyadiisii, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo sidaas daraaddeed Rabbiga ah Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil wuxuu leeyahay, Bal ogaada, belaayo weyn baan ku soo ridi doonaa Yeruusaalem iyo dalka Yahuudahba, si ku alla kii maqlaaba uu u argaggaxo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yeruusaalem korkeeda waxaan ku soo fidin doonaa xadhiggii Samaariya iyo xadhiggii miisaanka lahaa ee gurigii Axaab; oo Yeruusaalem waxaan u tirtiri doonaa siduu nin saxan u tirtiro oo kale, isagoo tirtira oo gembiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waan xoorayaa kuwa dhaxalkayga ka hadha, oo waxaan u gacangelinayaa cadaawayaashooda, oo iyana waxay cadaawayaashooda oo dhan u noqon doonaan dhac iyo wax la boobo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "maxaa yeelay, wax shar ah ayay hortayda ku samayn jireen oo way iga xanaajin jireen tan iyo maalintii awowayaashood ay Masar ka soo baxeen ilaa maantadan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba Manaseh wuxuu daadiyey dhiig badan oo aan xaq qabin ilaa uu ka buuxiyey Yeruusaalem dhinac ilaa dhinac, wuxuu kaloo sameeyey dembigiisii uu dadka Yahuudah dembaajiyey, markuu sameeyey wixii Rabbiga hortiisa sharka ku ahaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba Manaseh falimihiisii kale iyo wixii uu sameeyey oo dhan, iyo dembigiisii uu dembaabay oo dhammu sow kuma qorna kitaabkii taariikhda boqorradii dalka Yahuudah? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkaasaa Manaseh dhintay oo la seexday awowayaashiis, oo waxaa lagu aasay beertii gurigiisa, taasoo ahayd beertii Cuusaah, oo meeshiisiina waxaa boqor ka noqday wiilkiisii Aamoon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aamoon, Boqorkii Yahuudah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Aamoon markuu boqor noqday wuxuu jiray laba iyo labaatan sannadood, oo laba sannadoodna Yeruusaalem buu boqor ka ahaa, oo hooyadiis magaceedana waxaa la odhan jiray Meshullemed ina Xaaruus oo reer Yotbaah ahaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isna wuxuu sameeyey wax shar ku ah Rabbiga hortiisa, sidii aabbihiis Manaseh u yeelay oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu ku socday jidkii aabbihiis ku socday oo dhan, oo wuxuu u adeegay sanamyadii aabbihiis u adeegay oo dhan, wuuna caabuday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbiga ah Ilaahii awowayaashiisna wuu ka tegey oo kuma uu socon jidkii Rabbiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Aamoon addoommadiisii sirqooleen, oo waxay boqorkii ku dhex dileen gurigiisii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse dadkii dalka degganaa ayaa wada laayeen kuwii Boqor Aamoon sirqooleen oo dhan, markaasaa dadkii dalku waxay meeshiisii boqor ka dhigeen wiilkiisii Yoosiyaah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba Aamoon falimihiisii kale ee uu sameeyey sow kuma qorna kitaabkii taariikhda boqorradii dalka Yahuudah? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isagii waxaa lagu aasay qabrigiisii ku dhex yiil beertii Cuusaah, oo waxaa meeshiisii boqor ka noqday wiilkiisii Yoosiyaah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
